        "paragraph_id": "55D3D172",
        "text": "where τw is wind stress, ρa is density of air, Cd is the wind drag the coefficient, W is the wind velocity. The wind stress is turned off by default, and can be turned on specifying a constant wind velocity (keyword: windv = value) or by specifying a time varying wind file."
